D19_REPORT {"loop_seamless": null, "max_frame_step_deg": 21.918, "max_frame_step_at": [1, "foot.R"], "no_teleport": true, "bone_travel_mm": {"pelvis": 984.04, "chest": 998.58, "head": 1009.47, "hand.L": 1300.84, "hand.R": 1281.87}, "wall_eff_mm": 705.561, "wall_y_registered_mm": 705.561, "wall_penetration_max_mm": -0.0, "wall_penetration_at": 14, "wall_penetration_obj": "Hair_Mass", "wall_pen_tol_mm": 5.0, "wall_no_penetration_ok": true, "wall_no_penetration_note": "★★★ 本支头号守卫（「墙是硬的」**唯一**形式化）：全 0~34 帧、全部网格顶点，世界 y 必须 ≤ 墙面 + 5.0 mm。★ 它红了就是**穿墙**；它若在反向验证 ③ 里**不红**，说明这堵墙是装饰、本支不算完成。", "wall_contact_first_frame": 14, "wall_contact_frames": [14, 15, 16, 17], "wall_contact_expected": 14, "wall_contact_ok": true, "wall_contact_note": "★ 口径同 `foot_takeover_ok`：**首次** ≤ 阈值的帧必须唯一且 = `WALL_HIT`。反向验证 ② 把墙挪远 150 mm ⟹ 永远够不到 ⟹ 本判据红。", "wall_hit_rear_all_mm": 705.561, "wall_hit_rear_obj": "Hair_Mass", "wall_hit_rear_back_mm": 705.561, "wall_hit_rear_back_obj": "Hair_Mass", "wall_back_first_ok": true, "wall_back_first_note": "★ 清单原文要「**后背**撞墙」⟹ 撞墙帧 +Y 极值对象必须属于后背族（躯干/头颈/外套）。本支为此把**脚与手从身后收到身下偏前** —— 首 55 支里脚/手总是最靠后的，这是本支的姿态设计约束。", "wall_stay_y_dev_mm": 0.0, "wall_stay_y_tol_mm": 12.0, "wall_stay_gap_max_mm": 7.051, "wall_stay_gap_tol_mm": 18.0, "wall_stay_z_drop_mm": 190.831, "wall_stay_z_strictly_falling": true, "wall_stay_ok": true, "wall_stay_note": "★ 「短暂停留」= **贴着墙往下滑**：骨盆 y 钉住（≤12 mm）、后缘始终离墙 ≤18 mm、z 严格下降。反向验证 ⑤「原路弹回」必须让本判据红。", "wall_fall_seam_dv_mm": -1.361111111, "wall_fall_seam_dv_expected_mm": -1.361111111, "wall_fall_seam_ok": true, "wall_fall_vz_mm": {"26": -29.1685, "27": -30.5296, "28": -33.2518, "29": -35.9741, "30": -38.6963, "31": -41.4185, "32": -44.1407, "33": -46.8629, "34": -49.5852}, "wall_fall_vz_monotone_ok": true, "wall_fall_g_err_mm": 0.0, "wall_fall_g_err_at": 30, "wall_fall_g_tol_mm": 0.0001, "wall_fall_ok": true, "wall_fall_note": "★ 停留段结束（f26）后进入**新的**解析自由落体（`z = base + V·n − ½G·n²`）：竖速**从 f26 起严格更负**、f28..34 二阶差分 ≡ −G、且接缝 `vz(27)−vz(26)` 精确 = −G/2（速度连续，见上方